<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg">
    <meta name="description" content="Contact Harsh Solanki about software development opportunities, projects, and collaboration.">
    <meta property="og:type" content="website">
    <meta property="og:title" content="Contact | Harsh Solanki">
    <meta property="og:description" content="Get in touch with Harsh Solanki.">
    <title>Contact | Harsh Solanki</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.2/css/all.min.css">
</head>
<body id="top">
    <div class="background-circle circle-one"></div><div class="background-circle circle-two"></div>
    <%- include('partials/navbar') %>
    <main class="inner-page contact-page" id="main-content">
        <section class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Get in touch</p><h1>Let’s talk.</h1><p>Interested in an opportunity, a project, or a conversation about technology? Send me an email and I’ll get back to you.</p></section>
        <div class="contact-layout">
            <section class="contact-context">
                <span class="contact-large-icon"><i class="fa-regular fa-paper-plane"></i></span>
                <p class="eyebrow">Open to opportunities</p>
                <h2>Let’s build a connection.</h2>
                <p>I’m working toward a career in software development and welcome thoughtful conversations about learning, projects, and early-career opportunities.</p>
            </section>
            <section class="contact-email-card" aria-label="Email contact">
                <span class="contact-email-icon"><i class="fa-regular fa-envelope" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
                <p class="eyebrow">The best way to reach me</p>
                <h2>Email</h2>
                <a class="contact-email-address" href="mailto:solankiharsh870@gmail.com?subject=Portfolio%20enquiry&amp;body=Hi%20Harsh%2C%0D%0A%0D%0AI%27m%20getting%20in%20touch%20about%20your%20portfolio.%0D%0A%0D%0A">solankiharsh870@gmail.com</a>
                <p>The button opens a prefilled Gmail draft. You can also click the address to use your device’s default mail app.</p>
                <a class="primary-btn contact-email-button" href="https://mail.google.com/mail/?view=cm&amp;fs=1&amp;to=solankiharsh870%40gmail.com&amp;su=Portfolio%20enquiry&amp;body=Hi%20Harsh%2C%0D%0A%0D%0AI%27m%20getting%20in%20touch%20about%20your%20portfolio.%0D%0A%0D%0A" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Write an email <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
            </section>
        </div>
    </main>
    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
    <script src="/js/script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
